  "prompt": "Fix the root cause bug where recordEdit computes inverseKitDiff using post-change kit state instead of pre-change state. Fix all executeCommand callers to record edit before applying kit changes. Add missing keyboard shortcuts for Kit and Type apps. Fix Quality recordEdit qualityDiff gap. Update and pass Design Undo Redo Playwright test.",
